cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the gold-standard labels, please cite them as below."
title: "Developmental pathways and career outcomes in Japanese professional football: analysis code, pre-specified analysis plan, and adjudicated gold-standard labels"
abstract: >-
  Code, version-controlled analysis plan and manually adjudicated gold-standard
  labels for a study of pre-professional developmental pathways (club academy,
  high school, university) and reaching J1 by age 25 among players observed in
  the Japanese professional leagues, 1999-2025. The deposit includes the
  539-player independent validation sample with, for every verdict, the source
  URL and the verbatim quotation the rater relied on; the two pre-specified
  measurement gates and their judgements; and the sealed confirmatory run.
  Raw appearance records are not redistributed; collection scripts are provided
  so that they can be re-derived from the source.
type: software
